{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_013_02_h",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:50865bef2db0194cb85b616d1de5fe00fa40d2dc80fce31c56704942506d3cd2",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_h:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:667e2507e40be390049d40a2b9e74f2175fc662bef189618570db53a18240782",
      "text": "道流的家",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_h:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3264c9714c566b136eccba88484228a7266f553ed51abe86154b126350ac494d",
      "text": "涟居然会来我家，真稀奇啊。\n随便坐吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_h:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd2d874ac1ea8d08f86d5b7ae1064a04a5a705a1e0d8edf81515609c9faf314b",
      "text": "……啊？这布偶是什么玩意儿？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_h:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2dd4adc0c90a185d830f0ff9799aa93c4b51eb967f4f6db109ab852d24b0797",
      "text": "不是布偶，是编织玩偶啦。\n看，用这个毛线织出来的哦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_h:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1fa67d5bbe3451d11cab6fba174c5524cb9eca4dd78cc89ad1b0b1e1fa95e5ba",
      "text": "哪个都无所谓。\n比起那个……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_h:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95d69a8e131792a58ec88097942681e5e30f45fdd81516cd4ce9f7ec4fd3051a",
      "text": "偶像，到底是个什么东西啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_h:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25c945a1c82c1c7fd5898aab96a68885ef54978fda0c2058e03c7e15c6e22286",
      "text": "啊，难道是从武那里听说的？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_h:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3f0f146689722396751a4926b71370d5960d3bd98dda7b293b9695f4fa62edc",
      "text": "～～！小不点和拉面店的都说一样的话！\n废话少说，快点给我解释清楚！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_h:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70e248d4d57de8826103be7fef3cf00a23f48eb7e3d4d8b14fa76b75fd90240f",
      "text": "唔。其实我自己也还没能\n完全掌握全部就是了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_h:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:32582501427d83c46f3d400e9e466410ffa1f8f4ee4aba27e78ce43dd77aaf51",
      "text": "偶像好像是唱歌、跳舞，\n做各种各样事情的职业。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_h:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7550b9de21f879f4c4419ba57c0d95d331d2e3a001ee1b8fa190c613d25d885",
      "text": "然后我和武，\n决定在这个作为偶像的领域去决一胜负了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_h:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2fe6f2fe5727597be43d6ae4c19c78927c93ef95acd88b0a9235a37b8cc60da2",
      "text": "目标是大舞台！不过，首先为了\n成为偶像，我们得去挑战试镜才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
